utomation - Documentation Survey.\nAction: Info only\nLifecycle: General Availability\nType: New\nLine of Business: Technology\nLatest Revision: 2024-02-01\nValid as Of: 2024-02-01\nVersion: Cloud\n\n--- Record 3565 ---\nComponent: SAP Datasphere\nEnvironment: Cloud Foundry\nTitle: Features for Version 2024.3\nDescription: New and changed features are available for data cataloging, data integration, and data modeling.  For more information, see What's New in SAP Datasphere 2024.3. \nAction: Info only\nLifecycle: General Availability\nType: New\nLine of Business: Technology\nLatest Revision: 2024-02-01\nValid as Of: 2024-02-01\nVersion: Cloud\n\n--- Record 3566 ---\nComponent: Kyma Runtime\nEnvironment: Kyma\nTitle: Eventing: Deprecation of Subscription CR v1alpha1\nDescription: After introducing the Subscription CR v1alpha2 (see the blog post from March 2023), version v1alpha1 has been deprecated. The removal is planned for January 2024.  Once v1alpha1 is removed, you can only use v1alpha2 to create new subscriptions for events in Kyma Eventing. All existing v1alpha1 have already automatically been updated to the new version.  Read more about the Kyma Eventing Subscription CR.\nAction: Info only\nLifecycle: Deprecated\nType: Changed\nLine of Business: Technology\nLatest Revision: 2023-08-14\nValid as Of: 2024-01-31\nVersion: Cloud\n\n--- Record 3567 ---\nComponent: Cloud Logging\nEnvironment: Cloud Foundry\nTitle: OpenSearch has been updated\nDescription: We've updated OpenSearch and OpenSearch Dashboards to version 1.3.14.\nAction: Info only\nLifecycle: General Availability\nType: Changed\nLine of Business: Technology\nLatest Revision: 2024-01-31\nValid as Of: 2024-01-31\nVersion: Cloud\n\n--- Record 3568 ---\nComponent: Kyma Runtime\nEnvironment: Kyma\nTitle: Serverless module: Update to version 1.3.0\nDescription: We are excited to announce the release of the Serverless module 1.3.0. This version includes improved resiliency and introduces a fully declarative mod